1
00:01:32,740 --> 00:01:35,020
[OVERDO]

2
00:01:35,289 --> 00:01:37,850
[Episode 22]

3
00:01:57,229 --> 00:02:01,200
-Great!
-Great!

4
00:02:01,200 --> 00:02:03,460
-Congratulations!
-Congratulations!

5
00:02:47,079 --> 00:02:48,190
What a perfect match.

6
00:02:48,190 --> 00:02:49,750
They look so good together.

7
00:02:49,750 --> 00:02:51,150
He is so handsome.

8
00:02:51,680 --> 00:02:53,430
Miss Fang looks so beautiful
in that wedding dress.

9
00:02:53,430 --> 00:02:54,710
So beautiful.

10
00:02:54,710 --> 00:02:55,910
The bride is also very beautiful.

11
00:02:55,910 --> 00:02:56,680
Yes.

12
00:02:57,870 --> 00:02:58,930
She looks amazing.

13
00:03:01,080 --> 00:03:01,960
This wedding dress is so gorgeous.

14
00:03:01,960 --> 00:03:03,560
Truly a match made in heaven.

15
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:06,680
Wait.

16
00:03:07,630 --> 00:03:08,870
That is not Ren Susu.

17
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:18,730
My view is completely blocked.

18
00:03:20,079 --> 00:03:22,280
It seems I'll just have to play it by ear.

19
00:03:22,470 --> 00:03:23,470
Li Rongzhang.

20
00:03:24,120 --> 00:03:26,180
I will never let you leave here today.

21
00:03:41,430 --> 00:03:42,190
Boze.

22
00:03:43,079 --> 00:03:43,880
What's wrong?

23
00:03:45,870 --> 00:03:46,590
Nothing.

24
00:03:47,590 --> 00:03:49,450
I'm envious of this lovely couple

25
00:03:49,870 --> 00:03:51,270
that's getting married.

26
00:04:01,470 --> 00:04:03,600
Why does he look like he's seen a ghost?

27
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:09,120
He made a huge scene at home
a few days ago.

28
00:04:09,120 --> 00:04:10,630
I guess he's still upset.

29
00:04:12,430 --> 00:04:13,840
What is he up to again now?

30
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:16,680
Why do I have a bad feeling?

31
00:04:17,720 --> 00:04:18,750
Dear guests,

32
00:04:18,950 --> 00:04:20,680
please quiet down for a moment.

33
00:04:21,560 --> 00:04:22,270
Bride,

34
00:04:22,680 --> 00:04:24,040
do you take

35
00:04:24,040 --> 00:04:26,190
this man standing before you
as your husband,

36
00:04:26,190 --> 00:04:29,160
to love him, respect him,
and comfort him...

37
00:04:29,750 --> 00:04:32,800
Ren Susu,
what exactly are you planning to do?

38
00:04:33,070 --> 00:04:35,830
Whether you're in good times or bad,

39
00:04:36,480 --> 00:04:38,159
in sickness and in health,

40
00:04:38,800 --> 00:04:40,159
to be faithful,

41
00:04:40,510 --> 00:04:41,770
never abandoning him,

42
00:04:42,070 --> 00:04:42,950
until

43
00:04:42,950 --> 00:04:45,040
the end of your life?

44
00:04:47,720 --> 00:04:48,630
I do.

45
00:04:51,750 --> 00:04:54,040
I am willing to walk
side by side with you,

46
00:04:58,070 --> 00:04:59,830
be your safe harbor,

47
00:05:02,160 --> 00:05:03,000
love you,

48
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:08,270
and I promise

49
00:05:11,390 --> 00:05:14,990
to go through all the ups and downs
with you for the rest of my life.

50
00:05:16,270 --> 00:05:17,070
Groom,

51
00:05:17,560 --> 00:05:18,680
do you take

52
00:05:18,680 --> 00:05:21,240
this woman standing before you
as your wife,

53
00:05:22,430 --> 00:05:23,240
to love her,

54
00:05:23,830 --> 00:05:24,800
care for her,

55
00:05:25,160 --> 00:05:26,020
and respect her

56
00:05:26,510 --> 00:05:28,480
as you cherish your own soul,

57
00:05:29,270 --> 00:05:31,480
in sickness and in health,

58
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:33,430
to be faithful,

59
00:05:33,870 --> 00:05:35,130
never abandoning her,

60
00:05:35,270 --> 00:05:35,920
until

61
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:37,390
the end of your life?

62
00:05:40,159 --> 00:05:41,159
I do.

63
00:05:43,870 --> 00:05:45,000
I will always

64
00:05:45,430 --> 00:05:46,390
protect you.

65
00:05:48,480 --> 00:05:51,409
I will always protect you,
keeping you under my wing.

66
00:05:54,390 --> 00:05:55,650
I will always love you.

67
00:05:59,240 --> 00:06:00,360
I will be

68
00:06:01,920 --> 00:06:03,480
your most loyal partner.

69
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:07,240
And I also promise

70
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:10,600
that I will support your freedom

71
00:06:11,390 --> 00:06:12,240
and dreams.

72
00:06:24,160 --> 00:06:25,240
Ms. Ye...

73
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:32,150
I pronounce you husband and wife.

74
00:06:34,159 --> 00:06:37,630
-Great!
-Great!

75
00:07:02,310 --> 00:07:03,910
Please be seated, everyone.

76
00:07:04,240 --> 00:07:05,300
Good opportunity.

77
00:07:47,360 --> 00:07:49,510
Qingyu! Qingyu!

78
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:50,950
Qingyu!

79
00:07:51,720 --> 00:07:52,600
Qingyu!

80
00:07:57,040 --> 00:07:57,720
Qingyu!

81
00:07:58,480 --> 00:07:59,680
Qingyu!

82
00:08:17,310 --> 00:08:18,190
Qingyu!

83
00:08:18,510 --> 00:08:19,630
Qingyu!

84
00:08:21,430 --> 00:08:23,310
Mother! Mother!

85
00:08:25,560 --> 00:08:26,750
Brother!

86
00:08:28,310 --> 00:08:28,950
Brother!

87
00:08:31,510 --> 00:08:32,270
Qingyu...

88
00:08:32,270 --> 00:08:33,030
Somebody!

89
00:08:33,320 --> 00:08:34,320
Get the car ready!

90
00:08:44,030 --> 00:08:44,910
Somebody!

91
00:08:45,150 --> 00:08:46,030
Somebody!

92
00:08:49,270 --> 00:08:51,200
Doctor! Where is the doctor?

93
00:08:52,240 --> 00:08:53,030
Hurry!

94
00:08:53,630 --> 00:08:55,830
Get the car and send him to the hospital!

95
00:08:58,550 --> 00:08:59,320
Qingyu!

96
00:09:07,360 --> 00:09:08,550
Qingyi,

97
00:09:08,870 --> 00:09:12,030
you can't be willful anymore.

98
00:09:15,390 --> 00:09:16,440
Boze,

99
00:09:17,840 --> 00:09:21,000
take good care of Qingyi.

100
00:09:23,200 --> 00:09:24,360
The Murong family

101
00:09:25,480 --> 00:09:29,030
will always be your home.

102
00:09:36,840 --> 00:09:38,120
Fang Mulan!

103
00:09:38,510 --> 00:09:39,600
You bitch!

104
00:09:44,360 --> 00:09:45,080
Qingyi!

105
00:09:45,870 --> 00:09:46,550
Qingyi!

106
00:09:49,550 --> 00:09:51,080
Qingyu, don't fall asleep.

107
00:09:51,360 --> 00:09:54,000
Qingyu, don't fall asleep, okay?

108
00:09:54,240 --> 00:09:57,150
I'll get the doctor.
I'll get the doctor...

109
00:09:57,790 --> 00:09:58,630
Zhihong,

110
00:10:03,630 --> 00:10:04,960
I once

111
00:10:06,390 --> 00:10:07,840
dreamed

112
00:10:08,840 --> 00:10:10,360
of this wedding.

113
00:10:19,200 --> 00:10:20,440
I'm sorry.

114
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:23,600
You have nothing to be sorry for.

115
00:10:23,600 --> 00:10:24,630
I'm sorry.

116
00:10:25,200 --> 00:10:29,440
I can't fly... with you anymore.

117
00:10:30,240 --> 00:10:31,030
Qingyu.

118
00:10:31,390 --> 00:10:32,360
Qingyu.

119
00:10:34,910 --> 00:10:35,750
Principal!

120
00:10:37,870 --> 00:10:39,550
I heard you are very impressive.

121
00:10:39,550 --> 00:10:41,150
How about we race in the sky?

122
00:10:41,320 --> 00:10:41,960
Principal.

123
00:10:41,960 --> 00:10:44,270
She's a newcomer at our aviation school,

124
00:10:44,600 --> 00:10:45,720
Ye Zhihong.

125
00:10:48,840 --> 00:10:49,910
Let's race, then.

126
00:10:55,720 --> 00:10:56,510
Qingyu.

127
00:10:56,960 --> 00:10:58,030
Don't fall asleep.

128
00:10:58,030 --> 00:10:59,960
Please don't fall asleep.

129
00:11:00,480 --> 00:11:02,150
Qingyu, don't fall asleep.

130
00:11:02,630 --> 00:11:05,550
Qingyu, please don't fall asleep.
Qingyu...

131
00:11:06,150 --> 00:11:08,870
Qingyu.

132
00:11:12,910 --> 00:11:14,360
Why do you think

133
00:11:16,270 --> 00:11:18,600
you will lose your dream
if you are with me?

134
00:11:21,720 --> 00:11:22,750
Why

135
00:11:25,080 --> 00:11:27,280
are you not even willing to give it a try?

136
00:11:41,670 --> 00:11:44,120
Please don't fall asleep.

137
00:11:45,270 --> 00:11:45,840
You...

138
00:11:45,840 --> 00:11:48,840
You said you would stay with me.

139
00:12:08,200 --> 00:12:09,660
Who ordered you to do this?

140
00:12:18,030 --> 00:12:19,120
No one!

141
00:12:20,360 --> 00:12:21,360
No one.

142
00:12:23,080 --> 00:12:26,010
It's perfectly justified
for me to avenge my father.

143
00:12:27,320 --> 00:12:29,000
She is the one I want to kill!

144
00:12:30,270 --> 00:12:31,550
Fang Mulan!

145
00:12:32,790 --> 00:12:33,790
You bitch!

146
00:12:34,550 --> 00:12:35,790
Three years ago,

147
00:12:36,320 --> 00:12:37,910
you killed my father,

148
00:12:38,550 --> 00:12:41,200
and now you destroyed my family.

149
00:12:41,200 --> 00:12:42,320
It's justified for me

150
00:12:42,320 --> 00:12:44,780
-to kill you a thousand times over!
-Shut up!

151
00:12:45,910 --> 00:12:46,960
Speak.

152
00:12:47,240 --> 00:12:48,600
Who told you this?

153
00:12:55,320 --> 00:12:56,790
You probably don't know—

154
00:12:57,240 --> 00:13:00,080
she is not the daughter
of the Fang family at all.

155
00:13:00,790 --> 00:13:02,510
Her name is Ren Susu.

156
00:13:02,670 --> 00:13:06,200
Our Huo family orphanage took her in,

157
00:13:06,200 --> 00:13:08,150
giving her a cheap life.

158
00:13:09,150 --> 00:13:10,910
Ask your dear sister-in-law

159
00:13:11,320 --> 00:13:13,390
if she dares to take off her veil

160
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:15,240
and show everyone—

161
00:13:15,240 --> 00:13:16,320
Shut up!

162
00:14:09,910 --> 00:14:11,310
I've thought it through.

163
00:14:12,150 --> 00:14:14,010
We have no future together at all.

164
00:14:14,750 --> 00:14:16,480
You are the eldest young master
of the Murong family,

165
00:14:16,480 --> 00:14:18,880
the famous young marshal
of the Cheng Army.

166
00:14:19,630 --> 00:14:21,360
And I am a helpless orphan girl.

167
00:14:22,870 --> 00:14:23,870
Your wife

168
00:14:24,150 --> 00:14:24,960
should be someone

169
00:14:24,960 --> 00:14:27,960
who can share
your family responsibilities with you.

170
00:14:28,440 --> 00:14:29,900
But that's not what I want.

171
00:14:33,720 --> 00:14:34,780
Congratulations.

172
00:14:49,840 --> 00:14:50,870
Qingyu.

173
00:14:52,790 --> 00:14:54,790
I should have been brave earlier.

174
00:15:06,600 --> 00:15:07,390
Ms. Ye,

175
00:15:07,670 --> 00:15:08,530
leave quickly.

176
00:15:08,840 --> 00:15:10,970
I will make arrangements for the rest.

177
00:15:11,240 --> 00:15:12,080
I think

178
00:15:12,630 --> 00:15:14,360
the principal's greatest wish

179
00:15:14,870 --> 00:15:16,840
is probably for you to be safe.

180
00:16:17,080 --> 00:16:17,960
Zhihong.

181
00:16:36,240 --> 00:16:37,120
Zhihong.

182
00:16:38,720 --> 00:16:40,000
I'll see you off here.

183
00:16:44,770 --> 00:16:46,830
♪ I happened to ♪

184
00:16:45,120 --> 00:16:46,120
Actually,

185
00:16:46,850 --> 00:16:48,600
♪ Hear your name ♪

186
00:16:49,240 --> 00:16:50,630
my place is in the other direction.

187
00:16:49,730 --> 00:16:51,420
♪ And all the memories ♪

188
00:16:51,440 --> 00:16:54,640
♪ Came flooding back ♪

189
00:16:55,240 --> 00:16:56,150
I know.

190
00:16:55,620 --> 00:16:57,150
♪ There I stood in the falling snow ♪

191
00:16:57,180 --> 00:16:59,540
♪ Wrapped in my coat ♪

192
00:16:57,960 --> 00:16:58,960
I know

193
00:16:59,630 --> 00:17:01,550
you always take a detour to walk me—

194
00:17:00,550 --> 00:17:02,550
♪ My heart pounding ♪

195
00:17:03,080 --> 00:17:04,609
pretending to bump into me.

196
00:17:05,010 --> 00:17:06,720
♪ Walking down that old road ♪

197
00:17:06,780 --> 00:17:08,510
♪ Stopping every few steps ♪

198
00:17:07,349 --> 00:17:08,680
I can turn around,

199
00:17:09,730 --> 00:17:11,790
♪ In the misty train car ♪

200
00:17:09,880 --> 00:17:10,589
Qingyu.

201
00:17:11,900 --> 00:17:15,430
♪ I wish I could ask you once more ♪

202
00:17:12,200 --> 00:17:13,790
I can turn around.

203
00:17:16,369 --> 00:17:20,260
♪ If you have any ♪

204
00:17:19,240 --> 00:17:20,160
Zhihong,

205
00:17:20,359 --> 00:17:22,630
♪ New corny jokes to tell ♪

206
00:17:22,240 --> 00:17:23,480
I have to go.

207
00:17:25,510 --> 00:17:28,240
♪ Memories are like falling into a trap ♪

208
00:17:28,380 --> 00:17:30,550
♪ Full of mud ♪

209
00:17:29,070 --> 00:17:30,920
Qingyu, don't go.

210
00:17:30,610 --> 00:17:32,590
♪ The more I struggle,
the more suffocated I become ♪

211
00:17:33,080 --> 00:17:35,820
♪ But I couldn't resist collecting them ♪

212
00:17:35,840 --> 00:17:38,330
♪ I keep collecting ♪

213
00:17:37,240 --> 00:17:38,440
Qingyu...

214
00:17:38,400 --> 00:17:41,230
♪ Every word and comment ♪

215
00:17:39,790 --> 00:17:42,350
I really miss you.

216
00:17:41,310 --> 00:17:43,340
♪ They speak of you ♪

217
00:17:43,500 --> 00:17:45,940
♪ You're becoming clear ♪

218
00:17:46,000 --> 00:17:48,100
♪ So far yet so clear ♪

219
00:17:48,500 --> 00:17:51,060
♪ Ever since forgetting you ♪

220
00:17:51,110 --> 00:17:53,540
♪ Became second nature ♪

221
00:17:51,310 --> 00:17:52,160
Principal.

222
00:17:52,440 --> 00:17:53,510
What did you write?

223
00:17:54,160 --> 00:17:55,160
I wrote,

224
00:17:55,170 --> 00:17:56,770
♪ I still can't erase ♪

225
00:17:55,830 --> 00:17:57,350
"I hope Ms. Ye's paper airplane

226
00:17:56,790 --> 00:17:59,010
♪ Completely erase ♪

227
00:17:58,200 --> 00:17:59,460
will fly the highest."

228
00:17:59,610 --> 00:18:03,720
♪ The certainty of my hand in yours ♪

229
00:18:03,790 --> 00:18:05,980
♪ You are so clear ♪

230
00:18:06,090 --> 00:18:07,880
♪ So close and so clear ♪

231
00:18:08,690 --> 00:18:13,420
♪ If you possibly still have the courage ♪

232
00:18:13,440 --> 00:18:18,410
♪ Then take me away from here ♪

233
00:18:20,070 --> 00:18:22,310
♪ Please stop doubting ♪

234
00:18:22,330 --> 00:18:25,950
♪ My determination to run away with you ♪

235
00:18:49,160 --> 00:18:57,550
[Funeral]

236
00:20:04,160 --> 00:20:08,370
[Modern Surgery: General and Operative]

237
00:20:37,490 --> 00:20:40,000
[To: Murong Qingyi]

238
00:20:41,620 --> 00:20:44,780
[Three years ago, Nancheng,
Murong Mansion]

239
00:20:46,480 --> 00:20:47,400
Qingyi!

240
00:20:48,440 --> 00:20:49,640
What brings you back?

241
00:20:49,920 --> 00:20:52,350
You were injured,
shouldn't I come back to visit you?

242
00:20:52,350 --> 00:20:53,310
If you're always on crutches,

243
00:20:53,310 --> 00:20:54,640
you will never recover.

244
00:20:55,720 --> 00:20:57,270
I strained my ligament,

245
00:20:57,270 --> 00:20:58,200
and need to rest.

246
00:20:59,240 --> 00:21:00,440
Give me the crutches.

247
00:21:08,640 --> 00:21:09,900
You've got some nerve!

248
00:21:12,440 --> 00:21:13,030
Stop!

249
00:21:13,590 --> 00:21:14,680
Run faster!

250
00:21:14,680 --> 00:21:15,410
Give it to me!

251
00:21:17,350 --> 00:21:18,080
Give it to me!

252
00:21:26,550 --> 00:21:27,200
Qingyu.

253
00:21:27,350 --> 00:21:28,270
Are you okay?

254
00:21:28,880 --> 00:21:30,610
I haven't fully recovered yet.

255
00:21:32,200 --> 00:21:33,070
Seriously.

256
00:21:33,070 --> 00:21:34,200
You learned some skills

257
00:21:34,200 --> 00:21:35,800
and came back to mess with me.

258
00:21:37,030 --> 00:21:39,720
When people are excited,
adrenaline is released,

259
00:21:39,720 --> 00:21:41,000
which speeds up recovery.

260
00:21:41,000 --> 00:21:42,070
I'm helping you.

261
00:21:43,790 --> 00:21:44,880
Helping me?

262
00:21:45,480 --> 00:21:46,550
Excited?

263
00:21:46,830 --> 00:21:49,030
Adrenaline is released, huh?

264
00:21:49,510 --> 00:21:51,110
How about I release it on you—

265
00:21:51,310 --> 00:21:52,240
You can't hit me!

266
00:21:53,920 --> 00:21:55,030
I've worn the watch

267
00:21:55,240 --> 00:21:56,240
you gifted me for a long time.

268
00:21:56,240 --> 00:21:58,170
If it breaks, I'll be heartbroken.

269
00:22:03,590 --> 00:22:04,310
Sit down.

270
00:22:08,110 --> 00:22:09,750
You're so glib now.

271
00:22:10,830 --> 00:22:11,720
Are you back

272
00:22:11,880 --> 00:22:13,590
because something's wrong this time?

273
00:22:13,590 --> 00:22:14,270
Nothing's wrong.

274
00:22:14,270 --> 00:22:15,200
You were injured,

275
00:22:15,200 --> 00:22:16,530
so I came back to see you.

276
00:22:18,030 --> 00:22:18,830
You missed me?

277
00:22:22,310 --> 00:22:23,370
By the way, Qingyu,

278
00:22:23,680 --> 00:22:25,200
I've never told you

279
00:22:25,400 --> 00:22:27,000
why I study medicine, right?

280
00:22:27,550 --> 00:22:28,610
To heal the wounded

281
00:22:28,680 --> 00:22:29,880
and rescue the dying.

282
00:22:30,200 --> 00:22:31,330
It's more than that.

283
00:22:32,880 --> 00:22:34,540
When we were young, you told me

284
00:22:34,680 --> 00:22:36,540
you wanted to learn to fly a plane.

285
00:22:36,920 --> 00:22:38,000
I thought then,

286
00:22:38,270 --> 00:22:40,070
when the plane flies high,

287
00:22:40,070 --> 00:22:42,600
there must be a reliable doctor
on the ground.

288
00:22:43,310 --> 00:22:44,070
I wanted

289
00:22:44,440 --> 00:22:45,830
to protect you

290
00:22:45,960 --> 00:22:47,030
in my own way.

291
00:22:53,590 --> 00:22:54,520
So sentimental.

292
00:22:59,160 --> 00:23:00,160
Qingyi.

293
00:23:00,590 --> 00:23:01,590
I know

294
00:23:02,310 --> 00:23:03,400
you meant

295
00:23:03,400 --> 00:23:04,830
what you said

296
00:23:05,240 --> 00:23:06,440
about protecting me.

297
00:23:07,240 --> 00:23:08,480
Besides being happy,

298
00:23:08,480 --> 00:23:09,750
I was also thinking,

299
00:23:10,690 --> 00:23:14,310
[To: Murong Qingyi]

300
00:23:10,920 --> 00:23:12,240
is being a doctor

301
00:23:12,550 --> 00:23:14,440
what you truly want?

302
00:23:23,920 --> 00:23:25,270
I thought about it

303
00:23:26,070 --> 00:23:27,670
but couldn't find an answer.

304
00:23:37,030 --> 00:23:38,240
But there's one thing

305
00:23:39,160 --> 00:23:40,790
I can't say enough times

306
00:23:41,350 --> 00:23:42,590
to you.

307
00:23:43,550 --> 00:23:44,440
Qingyi,

308
00:23:44,750 --> 00:23:45,550
I only want you

309
00:23:45,720 --> 00:23:47,350
to do what you want,

310
00:23:47,880 --> 00:23:49,160
go where you want to go,

311
00:23:49,640 --> 00:23:51,770
and live freely following your heart.

312
00:23:53,790 --> 00:23:55,640
You disappear and run away
from home at the drop of a hat!

313
00:23:55,640 --> 00:23:57,510
Do you know there are people
who are worried about you?

314
00:23:57,510 --> 00:23:58,110
Who?

315
00:23:58,110 --> 00:23:59,310
Me!

316
00:24:12,440 --> 00:24:14,920
No matter how high you fly,

317
00:24:18,720 --> 00:24:20,000
look back—

318
00:24:21,030 --> 00:24:22,070
I

319
00:24:22,680 --> 00:24:24,680
will be waiting for you to come home.

320
00:24:51,170 --> 00:24:53,030
[Murong Residence]

321
00:24:53,650 --> 00:25:00,270
[Murong Residence]

322
00:25:14,320 --> 00:25:18,400
[Funeral]

323
00:25:39,070 --> 00:25:39,880
It's the 9th

324
00:25:40,070 --> 00:25:40,960
in 4 days—

325
00:25:41,400 --> 00:25:42,730
suitable for marriage.

326
00:25:42,920 --> 00:25:44,400
This is your own choice.

327
00:25:44,510 --> 00:25:45,400
Actually, you could also choose...

328
00:25:45,400 --> 00:25:46,920
To let others avenge me.

329
00:25:48,440 --> 00:25:51,200
Since I promised
not to involve the Murong family,

330
00:25:51,200 --> 00:25:54,000
I wouldn't let my sisters
take risks for me either.

331
00:25:54,160 --> 00:25:56,640
If I had listened to your advice
back then,

332
00:25:57,310 --> 00:25:59,480
would none of this have happened?

333
00:26:13,850 --> 00:26:16,170
[Funeral]

334
00:27:05,350 --> 00:27:07,490
[Mourning]

335
00:27:10,420 --> 00:27:12,920
[Mourning couplet]

336
00:27:24,680 --> 00:27:27,200
Young Master Li, the luggage is loaded.

337
00:27:27,200 --> 00:27:30,000
The Li family has been waiting outside
for 2 hours.

338
00:27:31,270 --> 00:27:32,310
My surname isn't Li.

339
00:27:32,310 --> 00:27:33,830
Let them wait if they want to.

340
00:27:33,830 --> 00:27:35,490
What does it have to do with me?

341
00:27:44,440 --> 00:27:45,720
When your mind is disturbed,

342
00:27:45,720 --> 00:27:47,440
your writing will be disturbed too.

343
00:27:47,440 --> 00:27:48,830
You won't be able to write

344
00:27:48,830 --> 00:27:50,760
the two characters "Murong" well.

345
00:27:54,960 --> 00:27:55,790
Brother,

346
00:27:56,160 --> 00:27:57,480
must I go?

347
00:27:57,790 --> 00:27:59,030
I don't want to leave.

348
00:28:03,620 --> 00:28:12,840
[Mu]

349
00:28:05,640 --> 00:28:07,900
Look at the character "Mu,"
it has 3 dots—

350
00:28:08,000 --> 00:28:10,400
just like 3 brothers
with deep affection.

351
00:28:11,200 --> 00:28:12,730
No matter how it is written,

352
00:28:13,200 --> 00:28:14,800
the structure of these 3 dots

353
00:28:14,880 --> 00:28:16,270
will never change.

354
00:28:16,960 --> 00:28:17,920
Brother.

355
00:28:18,440 --> 00:28:20,440
Am I a child of the Murong family,

356
00:28:20,750 --> 00:28:22,110
or the Li family?

357
00:28:23,000 --> 00:28:23,790
Boze.

358
00:28:24,310 --> 00:28:25,570
No matter where you are

359
00:28:25,960 --> 00:28:27,490
or what you do in the future,

360
00:28:27,920 --> 00:28:30,350
you are always a member
of the Murong family.

361
00:28:30,350 --> 00:28:31,270
The Murong family

362
00:28:31,270 --> 00:28:32,670
will always protect you.

363
00:28:33,350 --> 00:28:34,680
As long as we are around,

364
00:28:35,000 --> 00:28:35,800
we have a home.

365
00:28:48,720 --> 00:28:49,510
Mother.

366
00:28:50,880 --> 00:28:52,920
I wrote an elegy for Qingyu.

367
00:29:03,920 --> 00:29:05,000
Your handwriting

368
00:29:07,110 --> 00:29:09,070
is exactly like your brother's.

369
00:29:09,070 --> 00:29:10,400
Qingyu.

370
00:29:11,000 --> 00:29:12,830
You are alone over there,

371
00:29:14,240 --> 00:29:16,200
so cold and lonely.

372
00:29:18,680 --> 00:29:21,750
How can we not worry about you?

373
00:29:22,070 --> 00:29:22,960
Jinrui.

374
00:29:24,200 --> 00:29:26,060
The things I asked you to prepare,

375
00:29:27,110 --> 00:29:28,200
are they ready?

376
00:29:33,880 --> 00:29:34,680
Boze,

377
00:29:34,680 --> 00:29:35,310
come.

378
00:29:39,880 --> 00:29:40,920
Come with me

379
00:29:41,440 --> 00:29:43,440
to tidy up your brother's wardrobe.

380
00:29:44,830 --> 00:29:45,400
Let's go.

381
00:30:41,350 --> 00:30:43,150
If it weren't for this accident,

382
00:30:46,000 --> 00:30:48,130
you would already be husband and wife.

383
00:30:49,590 --> 00:30:50,920
Husband and wife should

384
00:30:51,960 --> 00:30:53,350
live

385
00:30:54,310 --> 00:30:55,880
and die together—

386
00:30:57,160 --> 00:30:58,680
never to be separated.

387
00:30:58,920 --> 00:30:59,960
Let me go!

388
00:31:01,160 --> 00:31:02,070
I think

389
00:31:08,110 --> 00:31:10,070
you also can't bear to leave him

390
00:31:10,270 --> 00:31:11,870
so lonely over there, right?

391
00:31:16,070 --> 00:31:16,790
Yes.

392
00:31:19,750 --> 00:31:21,400
Someone must accompany you.

393
00:31:23,270 --> 00:31:24,240
That way,

394
00:31:25,750 --> 00:31:27,590
you won't be so lonely,

395
00:31:28,400 --> 00:31:30,400
and won't become a wandering ghost.

396
00:31:37,070 --> 00:31:38,110
Let me go!

397
00:31:54,550 --> 00:31:55,880
What are you going to do?

398
00:31:59,590 --> 00:32:00,550
Qingyu,

399
00:32:01,400 --> 00:32:02,400
don't be afraid.

400
00:32:04,790 --> 00:32:06,920
She will come join you soon.

401
00:32:12,010 --> 00:32:17,810
[Funeral]

402
00:32:25,750 --> 00:32:26,530
Seal the coffin.

403
00:32:26,530 --> 00:32:27,850
[Funeral]

404
00:32:48,310 --> 00:32:49,240
Why are you here?

405
00:32:49,790 --> 00:32:51,190
You are not welcome here.

406
00:32:52,640 --> 00:32:55,040
I'm here to see my brother
for the last time.

407
00:33:15,680 --> 00:33:16,750
Where is Sister-in-law?

408
00:33:16,750 --> 00:33:19,810
Why are you always
thinking about your sister-in-law?

409
00:33:29,790 --> 00:33:30,720
Get out!

410
00:33:30,720 --> 00:33:31,720
I'm keeping vigil for your brother!

411
00:33:31,720 --> 00:33:32,720
Get out of the way!

412
00:33:44,350 --> 00:33:44,960
Someone!

413
00:33:45,200 --> 00:33:45,790
Throw him out!

414
00:33:45,790 --> 00:33:47,320
You are absolutely insane!

415
00:33:52,920 --> 00:33:53,640
Someone,

416
00:33:54,750 --> 00:33:55,880
take Miss Fang away.

417
00:33:56,240 --> 00:33:56,880
Yes.

418
00:34:20,840 --> 00:34:21,760
Cheng Jinzhi,

419
00:34:22,150 --> 00:34:23,150
you are a lunatic!

420
00:34:23,840 --> 00:34:25,800
How could you do such an evil thing?

421
00:34:26,070 --> 00:34:27,330
She's a living person!

422
00:34:27,960 --> 00:34:29,800
Don't think that
just because your brother is dead,

423
00:34:29,800 --> 00:34:31,600
you can reach the top in one step.

424
00:34:31,800 --> 00:34:32,730
I'm telling you—

425
00:34:33,030 --> 00:34:33,800
it is not your place

426
00:34:33,800 --> 00:34:35,030
to decide things for the Murong family.

427
00:34:35,030 --> 00:34:35,760
Why?

428
00:34:36,110 --> 00:34:37,400
Why do I not have a say?

429
00:34:39,030 --> 00:34:41,030
I was trying to warn
the Murong family back then

430
00:34:41,030 --> 00:34:43,560
when I was drugged with opium
and lost my mind.

431
00:34:44,190 --> 00:34:45,710
I risked my life for that information,

432
00:34:45,710 --> 00:34:47,170
but you didn't believe me.

433
00:34:47,190 --> 00:34:48,449
That's why Murong Feng

434
00:34:48,880 --> 00:34:50,739
was at the scene of the explosion.

435
00:34:51,150 --> 00:34:53,190
You are the one who killed your husband,

436
00:34:53,190 --> 00:34:54,230
not me.

437
00:34:54,230 --> 00:34:55,070
Shut up!

438
00:34:56,280 --> 00:34:57,680
Why should I believe you?

439
00:34:58,760 --> 00:35:01,110
You are just a dog raised by Li Rongzhang.

440
00:35:02,960 --> 00:35:04,190
He could easily use you

441
00:35:04,190 --> 00:35:05,720
to give false information.

442
00:35:06,760 --> 00:35:07,920
You don't accept discipline,

443
00:35:07,920 --> 00:35:09,380
disrespect your parents,

444
00:35:09,440 --> 00:35:10,970
and ignore admonishments.

445
00:35:14,400 --> 00:35:16,730
And now you've brought death to my Qingyu.

446
00:35:20,110 --> 00:35:20,670
Right.

447
00:35:21,400 --> 00:35:23,110
Even if you didn't kill your father,

448
00:35:23,110 --> 00:35:24,400
Qingyu died because of you!

449
00:35:24,400 --> 00:35:25,280
Nonsense!

450
00:35:25,630 --> 00:35:26,760
It's because of you.

451
00:35:27,000 --> 00:35:29,060
You are the jinx of the Murong family.

452
00:35:29,920 --> 00:35:32,000
You made our family become like this.

453
00:35:33,480 --> 00:35:34,880
You are a jinx.

454
00:35:35,110 --> 00:35:36,570
I don't have a son like you.

455
00:35:37,000 --> 00:35:38,000
Cheng Jinzhi,

456
00:35:38,840 --> 00:35:40,500
because you love Murong Feng,

457
00:35:41,030 --> 00:35:42,840
you forced him

458
00:35:43,960 --> 00:35:45,560
to stay by your side forever.

459
00:35:46,230 --> 00:35:47,510
But ask yourself,

460
00:35:48,510 --> 00:35:50,000
did Murong Feng love you?

461
00:35:50,000 --> 00:35:51,000
Shut up!

462
00:35:51,320 --> 00:35:52,720
How did you treat Qingyu?

463
00:35:53,110 --> 00:35:54,230
You treated him like a puppet.

464
00:35:54,230 --> 00:35:57,150
He never lived a second
for himself in his whole life.

465
00:35:57,150 --> 00:35:59,190
It's all because
you want to manipulate everyone

466
00:35:59,190 --> 00:36:00,670
that this family became like this!

467
00:36:00,670 --> 00:36:02,920
Shut up! Shut up! Shut your trap!

468
00:36:06,800 --> 00:36:08,400
Why wasn't it you who died?

469
00:36:08,400 --> 00:36:10,150
Why wasn't it you?

470
00:36:14,710 --> 00:36:15,670
I tell you,

471
00:36:16,440 --> 00:36:17,840
I've long been disgusted

472
00:36:18,630 --> 00:36:20,960
with everything about the Murong family.

473
00:36:31,480 --> 00:36:33,210
The Murong family rules state:

474
00:36:33,490 --> 00:36:35,150
♪ Must it take heartache ♪

475
00:36:33,630 --> 00:36:35,190
whoever wants to break ties
with the family

476
00:36:35,170 --> 00:36:37,440
♪ To know my heart belongs to you? ♪

477
00:36:36,480 --> 00:36:37,840
must suffer 3 stabs.

478
00:36:37,680 --> 00:36:39,980
♪ Hearts cold no more ♪

479
00:36:40,000 --> 00:36:41,700
♪ Is every sweet dream ♪

480
00:36:41,750 --> 00:36:43,810
♪ Destined to fade away? ♪

481
00:36:43,070 --> 00:36:44,440
I will give myself

482
00:36:44,440 --> 00:36:45,590
the first stab today.

483
00:36:44,500 --> 00:36:46,370
♪ Don't let it end in smoke ♪

484
00:36:46,280 --> 00:36:47,630
I couldn't choose my birth.

485
00:36:46,700 --> 00:36:49,880
♪ Never back down, hold my ground ♪

486
00:36:48,710 --> 00:36:50,030
But at least I can

487
00:36:50,010 --> 00:36:52,560
♪ Till I've given my all ♪

488
00:36:51,840 --> 00:36:53,630
choose how to live my life.

489
00:36:52,590 --> 00:36:53,630
♪ We ♪

490
00:36:54,710 --> 00:36:56,720
♪ Must be together ♪

491
00:36:57,550 --> 00:37:00,130
♪ Forevermore ♪
